{"seq":1,"slug":"model-serialization","title":"模型序列化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/deployment/model-serialization","wordCount":1069,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"模型序列化\">模型序列化</h1><h2 id=\"什么是模型序列化\">什么是模型序列化</h2><p>模型序列化（Model Serialization）是将训练好的模型保存为文件，以便后续加载用于推理或继续训练。这是将模型从实验环境部署到生产环境的第一步。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;训练完成的模型&lt;br/&gt;(内存中)&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;序列化&lt;br/&gt;保存到磁盘&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;模型文件&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;反序列化&lt;br/&gt;从磁盘加载&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;推理 / 继续训练&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"训练完成的模型&lt;br/&gt;(内存中)\"] --&gt; B[\"序列化&lt;br/&gt;保存到磁盘\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"模型文件\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"反序列化&lt;br/&gt;从磁盘加载\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"推理 / 继续训练\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>模型序列化围绕三个概念展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>序列化边界</strong>：把内存中的模型变成磁盘上的字节。关键在于&quot;保存了什么&quot;——<strong>权重（state_dict）与模型结构分离</strong>，前者稳定、后者与代码和库版本强绑定。</li>\n<li><strong>可移植性（Portability）</strong>：模型文件能否脱离原训练环境加载。这是 pickle 与 ONNX 的分水岭：前者依赖 Python 与库版本，后者是跨框架的中间表示。</li>\n<li><strong>安全边界</strong>：反序列化本质上是在执行文件里的代码。<strong>pickle 可以执行任意代码</strong>，因此&quot;不加载来路不明的模型文件&quot;不是建议而是硬约束。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三者的取舍回答了部署选型：<strong>本地复用选 pickle/joblib，跨环境部署选 ONNX，脱离 Python 运行选 TorchScript</strong>。而&quot;总是保存权重而非完整模型&quot;这条建议，正是第一点的直接推论。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"python-pickle\">Python Pickle</h2><p>Pickle 是 Python 原生的序列化方式，scikit-learn 模型最常使用 pickle 或 joblib 保存。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import pickle&#10;import joblib&#10;from sklearn.ensemble import RandomForestClassifier&#10;from sklearn.datasets import load_iris&#10;from sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split&#10;&#10;iris = load_iris()&#10;X_train, X_test, y_train, y_test = train_test_split(&#10;    iris.data, iris.target, test_size=0.3, random_state=42&#10;)&#10;&#10;model = RandomForestClassifier(n_estimators=100, random_state=42)&#10;model.fit(X_train, y_train)&#10;&#10;with open(&#39;/tmp/model_pickle.pkl&#39;, &#39;wb&#39;) as f:&#10;    pickle.dump(model, f)&#10;&#10;joblib.dump(model, &#39;/tmp/model_joblib.pkl&#39;)&#10;&#10;model_loaded = joblib.load(&#39;/tmp/model_joblib.pkl&#39;)&#10;print(f&quot;原始模型准确率:   {model.score(X_test, y_test):.4f}&quot;)&#10;print(f&quot;加载模型准确率:   {model_loaded.score(X_test, y_test):.4f}&quot;)&#10;&#10;import os&#10;pickle_size = os.path.getsize(&#39;/tmp/model_pickle.pkl&#39;)&#10;joblib_size = os.path.getsize(&#39;/tmp/model_joblib.pkl&#39;)&#10;print(f&quot;\\nPickle 文件大小: {pickle_size / 1024:.1f} KB&quot;)&#10;print(f&quot;Joblib 文件大小: {joblib_size / 1024:.1f} KB&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pickle</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> joblib</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.ensemble </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> RandomForestClassifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.datasets </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> load_iris</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.model_selection </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> train_test_split</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">iris </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> load_iris()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">X_train, X_test, y_train, y_test </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> train_test_split(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    iris.data, iris.target, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">test_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">random_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> RandomForestClassifier(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n_estimators</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">random_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model.fit(X_train, y_train)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">with</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> open</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/tmp/model_pickle.pkl'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'wb'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> f:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    pickle.dump(model, f)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">joblib.dump(model, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/tmp/model_joblib.pkl'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model_loaded </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> joblib.load(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/tmp/model_joblib.pkl'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"原始模型准确率:   </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model.score(X_test, y_test)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.4f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"加载模型准确率:   </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model_loaded.score(X_test, y_test)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.4f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> os</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pickle_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> os.path.getsize(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/tmp/model_pickle.pkl'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">joblib_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> os.path.getsize(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/tmp/model_joblib.pkl'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Pickle 文件大小: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pickle_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1024</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.1f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> KB\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Joblib 文件大小: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">joblib_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1024</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.1f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> KB\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>pickle</td>\n<td>Python 内置</td>\n<td>安全风险、版本依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>joblib</td>\n<td>大 NumPy 数组更高效</td>\n<td>同样有安全风险</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 永远不要加载不信任来源的 pickle 文件。Pickle 可以执行任意代码，存在严重的安全风险。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"pytorch-模型保存\">PyTorch 模型保存</h2><p>PyTorch 提供两种保存模型的方式：保存完整模型和只保存权重（推荐）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;&#10;class SimpleNet(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.fc1 = nn.Linear(10, 50)&#10;        self.relu = nn.ReLU()&#10;        self.fc2 = nn.Linear(50, 3)&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x):&#10;        return self.fc2(self.relu(self.fc1(x)))&#10;&#10;model = SimpleNet()&#10;&#10;torch.save(model.state_dict(), &#39;/tmp/model_weights.pth&#39;)&#10;&#10;model_loaded = SimpleNet()&#10;model_loaded.load_state_dict(torch.load(&#39;/tmp/model_weights.pth&#39;))&#10;model_loaded.eval()&#10;&#10;x = torch.randn(1, 10)&#10;with torch.no_grad():&#10;    out_original = model(x)&#10;    out_loaded = model_loaded(x)&#10;print(f&quot;输出一致: {torch.allclose(out_original, out_loaded)}&quot;)&#10;&#10;checkpoint = {&#10;    &#39;epoch&#39;: 50,&#10;    &#39;model_state_dict&#39;: model.state_dict(),&#10;    &#39;optimizer_state_dict&#39;: torch.optim.Adam(model.parameters()).state_dict(),&#10;    &#39;loss&#39;: 0.05,&#10;}&#10;torch.save(checkpoint, &#39;/tmp/checkpoint.pth&#39;)&#10;print(f&quot;Checkpoint 已保存&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SimpleNet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.fc1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Linear(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.relu </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.ReLU()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.fc2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Linear(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.fc2(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.relu(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.fc1(x)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SimpleNet()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">torch.save(model.state_dict(), </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/tmp/model_weights.pth'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model_loaded </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SimpleNet()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model_loaded.load_state_dict(torch.load(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/tmp/model_weights.pth'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model